I don't see why anyone has a problem with ghosts ( at least bones level
ghosts )....   Just leave them alone till you've more-or-less cleaned out
the level, wake the little bugger up, run to the up stairs ( or down if
you prefer ), wait for him/her/it to catch up, go up the stairs ( or down )
do a bit of careful dodging so that when you go back down the stairs the
ghost is not next to you, and voila!  He's left behind.  Since ghosts are
so pathetically slow, and do very little actual damage, this is usually no
problem.  Granted you may well have to deal with the guy on the way up, but
if at that time you can't handle a ghost, you shouldn't be there.

my 2gp worth.

